{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "42d5d310-a8cf-8d2c-93b2-0b097da315f8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:23:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniel Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:22:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Lorraine. My name is Daniel Kim. I've got an old refrigerator out in my garage and I'd like to know how I go about getting it hauled off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Kim, a refrigerator. Is it something you'd be putting out at the curb, or is it too heavy to move?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:22:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I can't move it, no. I'm in my eighties. It's got to be picked up from the garage, or at least the side of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Appliances like that usually need a special pickup arranged ahead of time, so I'll set up a request for you. Can I have the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "433 Coggeshall Avenue, up on the Hill. Not the boulevard, the avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "433 Coggeshall Avenue. Got it. And a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0171. Same number since 1989, never changed it once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's easy to remember. 401-555-0171, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one. Now, how do I request the pickup, is it just you, or is there a form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm entering the request right now, so you're all set on that. A crew member will call to confirm the day. Just keep it unplugged and the door taped shut or removed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Door's already off, believe it or not. Well, thank you, Lorraine, you've been a big help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My pleasure, Mr. Kim. You have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:23:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, dear. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
